(7451230, 1179456, 138630, '<td valign="top">Incredible moment and just wonderful to put it with this background - though I can''t help wondering what the original was - maybe less busy and I''d have liked that even better?  Just musing.  Gave it a 10 because it made me laugh.</td>', 'Incredible moment and just wonderful to put it with this background - though I can''t help wondering what the original was - maybe less busy and I''d have liked that even better?  Just musing.  Gave it a 10 because it made me laugh.', '2016-04-21 13:10:38.000000', NULL, 1),
(7451232, 1178858, 138630, '<td valign="top">Like an Old Master''s painting without any painterly effects.  Ethereal.  Love the tones.  Don''t know whether you needed Expert editing to create this magical scene - don''t care (though I''m always interested after the fact).  Well done and a 9 from me.</td>', 'Like an Old Master''s painting without any painterly effects.  Ethereal.  Love the tones.  Don''t know whether you needed Expert editing to create this magical scene - don''t care (though I''m always interested after the fact).  Well done and a 9 from me.', '2016-04-21 13:12:44.000000', NULL, 1),
(7451233, 1179473, 138630, '<td valign="top">A gorgeous structure, pleasing tones, and perfect symmetry.  I''m kind of guessing you mirrored this, but since it "could have been" given the subject, I''m only guessing that because you entered it in Expert and not the regular FS.  Love the title - found him lower left - I think :) 9 from me.</td>', 'A gorgeous structure, pleasing tones, and perfect symmetry.  I''m kind of guessing you mirrored this, but since it "could have been" given the subject, I''m only guessing that because you entered it in Expert and not the regular FS.  Love the title - found him lower left - I think :) 9 from me.', '2016-04-21 13:15:40.000000', NULL, 1),
(7451234, 1179465, 138630, '<td valign="top">Gorgeous tones and sky - love the contrast between that ethereal sky and the rugged rock foreground.</td>', 'Gorgeous tones and sky - love the contrast between that ethereal sky and the rugged rock foreground.', '2016-04-21 13:16:31.000000', NULL, 1),
(7451235, 1179332, 138630, '<td valign="top">I love this little scene - just a snippet caught in passing.  Processing is a little strong on the wall for me and I might have lost the cactus though it does contribute to the "found as is" look that is part of the charm here.  I really like it.</td>', 'I love this little scene - just a snippet caught in passing.  Processing is a little strong on the wall for me and I might have lost the cactus though it does contribute to the "found as is" look that is part of the charm here.  I really like it.', '2016-04-21 13:18:20.000000', NULL, 1),
(7451237, 1179069, 138630, '<td valign="top">Very nicely done.</td>', 'Very nicely done.', '2016-04-21 13:21:42.000000', NULL, 1),
(7451238, 1179449, 138630, '<td valign="top">Love everything about this except maybe how very white the owl is in the otherwise subtle and beautiful scene.  Still, I think it''s worth a bump.  9 now.</td>', 'Love everything about this except maybe how very white the owl is in the otherwise subtle and beautiful scene.  Still, I think it''s worth a bump.  9 now.', '2016-04-21 13:23:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(7451239, 1179438, 138630, '<td valign="top">Beautiful sky - a scene I will never enjoy in person.  I''m not crazy about the figure - which is weird because usually I love having a person in a landscape.  But here not so much.  Still a good score from me.</td>', 'Beautiful sky - a scene I will never enjoy in person.  I''m not crazy about the figure - which is weird because usually I love having a person in a landscape.  But here not so much.  Still a good score from me.', '2016-04-21 13:24:18.000000', NULL, 1),
