(7451561, 1179069, 1686, '<td valign="top">The picture is a composite of 4 images<br/>One with the bowl, box.fruit and silverware<br/>Two of pitcher pouring stream of milk<br/>Three the handle of the pitcher<br/>Four is the splash of the milk into the bowl with the berries suspended in its path on bamboo skewers<br/>Pictures 2,3 4 were masked to isolate one component then moved into place<br/>All 4 pictures were taken outside in bright sun light which gives it the high contrast and the sharp shadows<br/></td>', 'The picture is a composite of 4 imagesOne with the bowl, box.fruit and silverwareTwo of pitcher pouring stream of milkThree the handle of the pitcherFour is the splash of the milk into the bowl with the berries suspended in its path on bamboo skewersPictures 2,3 4 were masked to isolate one component then moved into placeAll 4 pictures were taken outside in bright sun light which gives it the high contrast and the sharp shadows', '2016-04-23 03:56:26.000000', NULL, 0),
