(7452333, 1179107, 65723, '<td valign="top">Yeah... I don''t get it.  How does anyone (even if you are a prude..) give this photo anything less than a 5 or 6?<br/>This photo has incredible composition.  So MANY things to look at (that Crown Moulding is AMAZING by the way..) and I find myself straining to see every detail of this photo.  It''s crazy too how the ONE model looks so different in each pose.  When my eyes dry out from scrutinizing a photo it tells me that it has my undivided attention and this one has done just that.  Bravo Paul~!</td>', 'Yeah... I don''t get it.  How does anyone (even if you are a prude..) give this photo anything less than a 5 or 6?This photo has incredible composition.  So MANY things to look at (that Crown Moulding is AMAZING by the way..) and I find myself straining to see every detail of this photo.  It''s crazy too how the ONE model looks so different in each pose.  When my eyes dry out from scrutinizing a photo it tells me that it has my undivided attention and this one has done just that.  Bravo Paul~!', '2016-04-27 21:19:05.000000', NULL, 0);
